+/* MGS2 fast paths, all switchable at runtime so a regression can be ruled out on
+ * the device without a rebuild:
+ *   MGS2_D3D8_STATEFAST=0        stop dropping redundant state calls
+ *   MGS2_D3D8_MANAGED_DIRTY=0    upload managed textures on every draw again
+ *   MGS2_D3D8_STATS=1            one counter line per second
+ *
+ * Renderer no-op ladder. Diagnostic only: each rung deletes more of the draw
+ * path so the frame time it is worth attributing to that path can be read off
+ * directly. The picture is wrong in every rung -- these are never a shipping
+ * setting. Rung A answers "how much CPU is in D3D8+WineD3D at all", B isolates
+ * the cost of building and submitting the CS packet, C isolates the consumer
+ * side (WineD3D -> GLES -> Mali). Run all three plus a baseline at one fixed
+ * Plant spot and one fixed clock, or the numbers measure the scene.
+ *   MGS2_D3D8_NOOP_DRAW=1        rung A: Draw* returns before the mutex
+ *   MGS2_D3D8_NOOP_SUBMIT=1      rung B: everything but wined3d_device_context_draw
+ * Rung C lives in wined3d (MGS2_WINED3D_NOOP_DRAW=1).
+ */
